{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1219893-w-tf-auspice-and-tribe-spotify-playlists","id":1219893,"title":"W:tF Auspice and Tribe Spotify Playlists","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-05-18T00:26:07-07:00","id":1219893,"title":"W:tF Auspice and Tribe Spotify Playlists","content":"<div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252c2f\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">I've been surfing Spotify for playlists about a specific auspice or tribe, and there don't seem to be any, so I came here in hopes of having help building some for games.</span></span></span></div> <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252c2f\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Example format;</span></span></span></div> <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252c2f\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">\u200bBlood Talons: Am I Savage? (Metallica)</span></span></span></div> <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252c2f\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">\u200bGo nuts, come up with some accurate ones, and I'll figure out how to post playlists here for you guys to use.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Edit: A list of playlists are on page 4, post #51.</span></span></span></div></div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/13.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":4793,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4793-hunterinthenight","user":"HunterInTheNight","date":". 06-10-2018, 04:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4793-hunterinthenight","name":"HunterInTheNight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"168"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-18T03:58:25-07:00","id":1219915,"title":"","content":"I've been working on a Forsaken playlist alongside my Requiem one, but I've not been able to find all that many songs yet. I've been having particular trouble finding stuff for the Bone Shadows.<br /> <br /> -<br /> The Forsaken: Brother Wolf, Sister Moon (The Cult)<br /> Iron Masters: Jungle (X Ambassadors, Jamie N Commons)<br /> Storm Lords: Eye of the Storm (Watt White)<br /> -<br /> -<br /> The Pure<br /> Fire Touched: Shepherd of Fire (Avenged Sevenfold)<br /> -<br /> <br /> Hungry Like the Wolf (Duran Duran) - I personally use a cover of this as my 'Main Theme' for Werewolf as a whole, but I could see it being pretty good for the Hunters In Darkness.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-18T04:37:34-07:00","id":1219922,"title":"","content":"Florence and the Machine's 'Howl' was one of the key theme songs for developing Forsaken 2e.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-18T06:59:36-07:00","id":1219952,"title":"","content":"Musically I tend to go with things like the Supernatural themes or The Secret World\u2019s themes. For Auspice and Tribe I\u2019d tend to hit the greatest of Mullet Rock :P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5439-gullinbursti","name":"Gullinbursti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5439_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"291"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-18T09:27:00-07:00","id":1219990,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kleptomania</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1219893-w-tf-auspice-and-tribe-spotify-playlists?p=1219915#post1219915\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hungry Like the Wolf (Duran Duran) - I personally use a cover of this as my 'Main Theme' for Werewolf as a whole, but I could see it being pretty good for the Hunters In Darkness.</div> </div> </div> </div>What cover you have in mind? I like the lyrics for <b>Werewolf</b>, only this 80s upbeat tunes of Duran Duran version...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-18T12:48:42-07:00","id":1220065,"title":"","content":"I think that <b>Disturbed</b> is spot on band for the primal urge all werewolves feel. Especially for Rage or Hunt is suitable song <b>Animal</b>. Here is ( controversial ) video. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dwxUgefMStM\" data-code=\"dwxUgefMStM\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/dwxUgefMStM/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-18T12:49:45-07:00","id":1220066,"title":"","content":"How has no one suggested &quot;Werewolves of London&quot; yet?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23991-bacchicone","name":"BacchicOne","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23991_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-18T12:53:09-07:00","id":1220070,"title":"","content":"It's a bit spot on, and doesn't really get into werewolf more than the term, so doesn't really get into the auspices or tribes at all. Something like Big Data's Dangerous or MOP's Ante Up or Immortal Technique's War Is My Destiny are appropriate for Iron Masters and Garmir, respectively. Welcome to the Jungle fit for Bone Shadows, Sympathy for the Devil for Bale Hounds, Aisha by Death in Vegas for the Hunters in Darkness.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 05-18-2018, 03:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-18T13:45:27-07:00","id":1220081,"title":"","content":"Auspices ideas:<ul><li><b>Cahalith</b> - <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RgTSecY_H9Y\" target=\"_blank\">BAD MOON RISING - Creedence Clearwater Revival - Metal Version</a></li> <li><b>Elodoth </b>- <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=czb_CZfWko8\" target=\"_blank\">I Prevail - Blank Space (Taylor Swift Cover)</a></li> <li><b>Ithaeur </b>- <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5KbZTumKxhg\" target=\"_blank\">The Rinn - Moonlight Shadow (Mike Oldfield cover)</a></li> <li><b>Irraka</b> - <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u9Dg-g7t2l4\" target=\"_blank\">Disturbed - The Sound Of Silence</a></li> <li><b>Rahu</b> \u2013 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ErZLFofFkGg\" target=\"_blank\">Disturbed \u2013 Sacred Lie</a></li> </ul>Pure Tribes ( as whole ), shouting to the Forsaken - <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KMp5PESrYaw\" target=\"_blank\">Disturbed \u2013 Forgiven</a> ( Yeah, only change title of song to Forsaken <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 05-18-2018, 04:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-19T23:29:23-07:00","id":1220451,"title":"","content":"Iron Masters <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/user/dinohunter_1-3/playlist/0L3wa4sk7kD7iLu4k1iHZc?si=6ZXBqZvjQu2xgH_k6Zr_Cg\" target=\"_blank\">https://open.spotify.com/user/dinohu...Qu2xgH_k6Zr_Cg</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/13.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4793-hunterinthenight","name":"HunterInTheNight","avatar":"data:image/svg